# Core Components

Headroom automatically routes content to the most suitable optimization engine.

## SmartCrusher

Optimized for structured data:

- JSON
- Nested objects
- Arrays
- API responses

---

## CodeCompressor

AST-aware compression supporting:

- Python
- JavaScript
- TypeScript
- Go
- Rust
- Java
- C++
- C#

Code structure is preserved while redundant context is minimized.

---

## Kompress-v2

A machine-learning model trained specifically for AI context compression.

Designed for:

- Documentation
- Natural language
- RAG content
- Logs
- Mixed text

---

## Image Compression

Optimizes visual context before it reaches multimodal language models.

Supported workloads include:

- Screenshots
- UI captures
- Diagrams
- Technical drawings
- Mixed documents

---

## CacheAligner

Improves prompt cache efficiency by stabilizing shared prompt prefixes.

Benefits include:

- Higher cache hit rates
- Lower latency
- Reduced inference costs

---

## Intelligent Context Manager

Automatically prioritizes the most relevant information when context windows approach model limits.

Key capabilities include:

- Context ranking
- Importance scoring
- Rolling window management
- Semantic prioritization

---

## Cross-Agent Memory

Multiple AI agents can securely share compressed context.

Supported workflows include:

- Claude Code
- Codex
- Cursor
- Continue
- OpenHands
- Goose

This reduces duplicate processing across collaborative agent workflows.

